    {
      "line": 591,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）∵ cos （θ +  $ \\frac{\\pi}{2} $）= cos θ cos  $ \\frac{\\pi}{2} $ - sin θ sin  $ \\frac{\\pi}{2} $ = - $ \\frac{4}{4} $， $ \\frac{1}{2} $ -  $ \\frac{3}{3} $， $ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} $ -  $ \\frac{4 + 3\\sqrt{3}}{3} $"
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "27."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 595,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "【考点】棱柱、棱锥、棱台的体积；空间中直线与直线之间的位置关系."
    },
    {
      "line": 596,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 597,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "【分析】（Ⅰ）根据线面垂直的性质定理证明 BC⊥平面  $ ABB_{1}A_{1} $，即可证明：BC⊥AD；"
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 599,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）利用转化法结合三棱锥的体积公式即可求三棱锥 B-ACD 的体积."
    },
    {
      "line": 600,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "【解答】证明：（Ⅰ）在三棱柱 ABC - A_{1}B_{1}C_{1} 中，BB_{1}⊥平面 ABC， $ \\angle ABC=90^{\\circ} $"
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 603,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": " $$ \\therefore\\mathrm{BC}\\perp\\mathrm{AB}, $$ "
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 605,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "∵$BB_{1}$⊥平面 ABC，BZ⊂平面 ABC，"
    },
    {
      "line": 606,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": " $$ \\therefore\\mathrm{BB}_{1}\\perp\\mathrm{BC}, $$ "
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": " $$ \\because BB_{1}\\cap AB=B, $$ "
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 611,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": " $ \\therefore BC \\perp $ 平面  $ ABB_{1}A_{1} $"
    },
    {
      "line": 612,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "∵AD⊂平面  $ ABB_{1}A_{1} $,"
    },
    {
      "line": 614,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 615,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": " $$ \\therefore\\mathrm{BC}\\perp\\mathrm{AD}. $$ "
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "（Ⅱ）$\\because BC \\perp$ 平面 $ABB_{1}A_{1}$，"
    },
    {
      "line": 618,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 619,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "∴BC 是三棱锥 C-ABD 的高，"
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 621,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "则  $ V_{B-ACD}=V_{C-ABD}=\\frac{1}{3}S_{\\triangle ABD}\\cdot BC=\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot BB_{1}\\cdot BC=\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{1}{2}\\times2\\times1=\\frac{1}{3} $"
    },
    {
      "line": 622,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "in_range": true,
      "text": "即  $ V_{B-ACD}=\\frac{1}{3} $."
    },
    {
      "line": 624,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 625,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": "28."
    },
    {
      "line": 626,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "in_range": false,
      "text": "【考点】直线与圆的位置关系."
    }
  ],
